{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_request_to_method_project_fill_limit_request_fill_limit", "label": "Request \u2014 settle the tower fill-limit, or prove it cannot be settled", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-to-method-project-FILL-LIMIT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Either close the bracket or certify it closed-as-open; the certified-open verdict is itself a publishable result and a fully acceptable answer."}, {"id": "recovered_request_to_method_project_fill_limit_fill_law_per_axis_ratio", "label": "The fill law \u2014 each axis multiplies the box by more than it multiplies the object", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-to-method-project-FILL-LIMIT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A constrained coordinate has mean multiplicity strictly below its own value count, so fill is monotone decreasing and bounded below and therefore converges."}, {"id": "recovered_request_to_method_project_fill_limit_infinite_product_criterion", "label": "The infinite-product criterion is the exact residue", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-to-method-project-FILL-LIMIT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Strictly below 1 is not bounded away from 1: the product vanishes iff the sum of the complements diverges, and six non-monotone measured ratios cannot fix the asymptotics of an open-ended sequence."}, {"id": "recovered_request_to_method_project_fill_limit_certified_open_verdict", "label": "Certified-open verdict (outcome C)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-to-method-project-FILL-LIMIT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A proof that the construction alone cannot decide the value upgrades an honest silence into a proved boundary."}, {"id": "recovered_request_to_method_project_fill_limit_build_project_charter_bound", "label": "Why the build project cannot settle it", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-to-method-project-FILL-LIMIT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Settling it requires the axis-generating law, which is the physical input that stopped being supplied at thirteen; that is new subject matter, not construction."}], "edges": [{"source": "recovered_request_to_method_project_fill_limit_request_fill_limit", "target": "recovered_request_to_method_project_fill_limit_fill_law_per_axis_ratio", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-to-method-project-FILL-LIMIT.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_request_to_method_project_fill_limit_infinite_product_criterion", "target": "recovered_request_to_method_project_fill_limit_fill_law_per_axis_ratio", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-to-method-project-FILL-LIMIT.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_request_to_method_project_fill_limit_certified_open_verdict", "target": "recovered_request_to_method_project_fill_limit_request_fill_limit", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-to-method-project-FILL-LIMIT.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_request_to_method_project_fill_limit_build_project_charter_bound", "target": "recovered_request_to_method_project_fill_limit_request_fill_limit", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "recovered/REQUEST-to-method-project-FILL-LIMIT.md", "sou